<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp lowered to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News Corp lowered to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst John Tinker said he lowered his rating on The News Corp Ltd to a hold from a buy. No further information was given.</p>
